From df486f41b6fb8de369adca02d1afc39cfa0f7803 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:22:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] perf(trafficcraft): send sign texture resets only to
 the chunk's players

A new sign texture sent TrafficSignTextureResetPacket to every player in the
dimension, but its client handler only resets a TrafficSignBlockEntity found
at that position. Send it to the players vanilla sends that chunk's block
updates to (ChunkMap#getPlayers(pos, false)), as DragonLib's own update
helper does; clients without the chunk never had the sign loaded. Levels
that are not server levels keep the full list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
---
